  "text": "You wear the blouse in fine white polka dots with black tailored trousers, a beige vest for layering, and Tamaris loafers. The bag is carried on your shoulder, and no jewelry or hair styling is included.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the blouse untucked to let the loose hem fall over the high-waisted trousers, softening the waistline without marking it.",
    "Let the vest sit open as an airy layer that adds warmth without adding bulk, keeping your silhouette clean."
